{"title":"2024 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2024 AMC 10B #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">2024 AMC 12B #3</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Modified_Problem_in_Certain_China_Testpapers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Modified Problem in Certain China Testpapers</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_for_Certain_China_Testpapers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution for Certain China Testpapers</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Apex_STEM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Apex STEM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_(Fast_and_Easy_⚡🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many integer values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/9/689343b685923b5dc5c6be65013f6813da2c24e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2x| \\leq 7 \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/1/9f15f1e100993314e7ab520f37908b8d861b35d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 17 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 19 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Modified_Problem_in_Certain_China_Testpapers\">Modified Problem in Certain China Testpapers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Modified Problem in Certain China Testpapers\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>For how many integer values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/4/8b477738fa90164a6d77ad51f8e93473a0d3b812.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2x| \\leq 6 \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/1/9f15f1e100993314e7ab520f37908b8d861b35d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 17 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 19 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_for_Certain_China_Testpapers\">Solution for Certain China Testpapers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution for Certain China Testpapers\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/2/ae2e2af7498c2ea83f740a76293cfa0b731cae67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi \\approx 3.14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />, and thus you can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e41f2be52b3448cb553b9bcc132e237dc6dbd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\pi \\approx 18.84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" />. We could easily see that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/306dd9629460cde397191d5c02dbce63ab0fc4a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{-9,-8,...,8,9\\}\\implies\\boxed{\\text{(C) }19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"242\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~RULE101\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/486cdb566f35e38d3622421ea00469c03b014b9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi = 3.14159\\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"124\" height=\"14\" /> is slightly less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/c/29c2b5c8667fc311c5848bebadea0c72508b9408.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{22}{7} = 3.\\overline{142857}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"117\" height=\"38\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d54e728c4eccacffa824340b51f3e9d529ddc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\pi \\approx 21.9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />\nThe inequality expands to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c17b69d02babbbbb60b189151fcc192e793d938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-21.9 \\le 2x \\le 21.9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />. We find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can take the integer values between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d7701e9469f26e22c106341791344b28f3196443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> inclusive. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b32fd0d2390ab455f444fb7918cb5cc26c62d208.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{E. }21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"53\" height=\"25\" /> such values.\n</p><p>Note that if you did not know whether <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> was greater than or less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/3/2c33d018364a1385e03c48ca14f162cfc4308562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{22}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, then you might perform casework. In the case that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/e/45e6f16571e2ec9d64e9583b32dc1051e7208494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi &gt; \\dfrac{22}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />, the valid solutions are between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a02f41eb5e5177856903c4041647e096b7413a14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> inclusive: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> solutions. Since, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is not an answer choice, we can be confident that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/8/35867e0bd3430795b49107a1b4e023e34a7cc156.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi &lt; \\dfrac{22}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />, and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a26e88745e62fd3c7f06cac64c45b081d11dd30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{E. } 21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"53\" height=\"25\" /> is the correct answer.\n</p><p>~numerophile\n</p><p>Test advice: If you are in the test and do not know if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/458baa8df946d77715f36061b60a5b526a628c07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{22}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> is bigger or smaller than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" />, you can use the extremely sophisticated method of just dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/3/2c33d018364a1385e03c48ca14f162cfc4308562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{22}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> via long division. Once you get to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/1/b01d9f178aee53530639205fdad4fdfbd6dcd94b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.142$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> you realise that you don't need to divide further since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c95e88b4ea555cd2e9fac9c391227163c1573a6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi = 3.1416$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" /> when rounded to 4 decimal places.Therefore, you do not include <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a02f41eb5e5177856903c4041647e096b7413a14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> and the answer is 21.\n</p><p>~Rosiefork (first time using Latex)(and a complete noob)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6feea94b21a7db3646d7529bb4d7d1a0d88a48b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\pi$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> is incredibly close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, but doesn't reach it. This can be both computed by using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df6b1c1b87c2e9c3e552be726c9f8ad9e2a1f152.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi\\approx3.142\\implies7\\cdot3.142=21.994&lt;22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"309\" height=\"15\" /> or assumed. Therefore, including both positive and negative values, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/04260d97d6560689ff60624e9519390cd9ee67dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{-10,-9,...,9,10\\}\\implies\\boxed{\\text{(E) }21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"259\" height=\"30\" />. ~Tacos_are_yummy_1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Apex_STEM\">Video Solution 1 by Apex STEM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Apex STEM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/NXY4bRmTCYI\">https://youtu.be/NXY4bRmTCYI</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_.28Fast_and_Easy_.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_(Fast_and_Easy_⚡🚀)\">Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DIl3rLQQkQQ?feature=shared\">https://youtu.be/DIl3rLQQkQQ?feature=shared</a>\n</p><p>~ Pi Academy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=24EZaeAThuE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=24EZaeAThuE</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fJ2WqG-pchY\">https://youtu.be/fJ2WqG-pchY</a>\n</p><p>~TheSmartGreekMathDude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\